{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19916","headline":"秋怀 十一 · 孟郊","name":"秋怀 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽苦日日甚，老力步步微。\n常恐暂下牀，至门不复归。\n饥者重一食，寒者重一衣。\n泛广岂无涘，恣行亦有随。\n语中失次第，身外生疮痍。\n桂蠹既潜朽，桂花损贞姿。\n詈言一失香，千古闻臭词。\n将死始前悔，前悔不可追。\n哀哉轻薄行，终日与驷驰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}